[00:00.00] 作词 : 赵子健
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 赵子健
[00:03.13]编曲：刺猬
[00:03.14]
[00:03.15]Oh lord please find me a clone
[00:09.91]So I can seperate myself against my world
[00:17.56]Oh lord can you find me a door
[00:24.48]To the world where people were all nice and warm
[00:31.19]Oh lord please find me a tunnel
[00:38.57]Where I can hear all the sounds around me are echoing
[00:45.34]Oh lord please find me some coke
[00:52.79]So I can get sober enough to code
[01:01.16]
[01:59.34]Oh dear lord can you hear me or not?
[02:05.03]Can you hear me when I call for help
[02:12.76]一切美好的事物皆源于模仿艺术
[02:20.62]艺术源于孤独者捕捉生活的痛楚
[02:29.17]Oh lord please find me a girl
[02:36.36]Who I can tell her all about my world
[02:44.45]Oh lord please find me my soul
[02:52.21]Then I can feel my life is not a joke
[02:59.71]Oh lord please find me love
[03:07.94]So I have no need to be depress anymore
[03:15.34]Oh lord please find me love
[03:23.34]And let me fall into a real world
[03:31.67]
